Notebook[{
Cell["Han Kitab \:00b7 Project Context v002 (21 November 2026)", "Title"],
Cell["\:00a9 Computational Classnotes \:00b7 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "Text"],
Cell["State\n- Repo: https://github.com/lossofgenerality/han-kitab (main). Live: https://lossofgenerality.github.io/han-kitab/ (one fixed address; the app is index.html, no app versions).\n- App: `HanKitab_v002.html` \:2014 Library, Read (English / English + \:4e2d\:6587 / \:4e2d\:6587), Search, Ask, Downloads, About; installable, offline.\n- Texts: Mason, *The Arabian Prophet* (1921) clear-text edition v002; \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 (1924) facsimile v001 (prefaces + juan 1\:201310); research report v001; both original scans unchanged in `originals/`.\n- Kernel: HanKitabKernel v002 at https://www.wolframcloud.com/obj/ccn2/HanKitabKernel; chat open to readers (no key), capped at 1500 tokens; code evaluation needs the owner secret (HanKitab/secret, and the private file in Desktop/Research/HanKitab). Chat key: HanKitab/apikey once stored, otherwise LaplacianLab/apikey.\n- Notebooks: wolfram/ and Desktop/Research/HanKitab (Kernel, OperationsLog T001\:2013T032 / DO001\:2013DO008, DevelopmentLog, Scripts).", "Section"],
Cell["Open tasks\n1. Store your own chat key as HanKitab/apikey (Step 1 of HanKitabKernel_v002.nb); the kernel picks it up at once.\n2. \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 juan 11\:201320: find a scan of the second half (NLC, CTEXT library or NDL) and add it the same way.\n3. Proofread the Mason clear text; type in the Chinese characters marked [Chinese] from the scan.\n4. A faithful typed Chinese text of \:5929\:65b9\:81f3\:8056\:5be6\:9304 (only by reading every page; machine reading was ~80 %).\n5. More Han Kitab texts: \:5929\:65b9\:6027\:7406 (Commons NLC scans, ANU manuscript), \:5929\:65b9\:5178\:79ae (ANU), \:5929\:65b9\:6b63\:5b78 (Commons).\n6. Conventions files not yet made: Tutorial, Manual, Flowchart, Acronyms notebooks.", "Section"],
Cell["How to resume\nClone the repo, run `python3 tools/make_app.py` after any app or text change (index.html is overwritten; documents and notebooks still get new versions), log new (T)/(DO) entries in `tools/make_notebooks_v003.py`, commit as Noor Hoshino, push, verify with `git ls-remote` and the live page, copy notebooks to Desktop/Research/HanKitab.", "Section"],
Cell["\:00a9 Computational Classnotes \:00b7 CC BY-NC-SA 4.0", "Text"]
}, WindowTitle -> "HanKitabProjectContext_v002.nb"]
